.TH QUIPU-RENDER 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-render \- Render graph data into files in an owned directory
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu render\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-dest\fR] [\fB\-\-graph\fR] [\fB\-\-valid\-at\fR] [\fB\-\-server\fR] [\fB\-\-query\fR] [\fB\-\-template\fR] [\fB\-\-layout\fR] [\fB\-\-path\fR] [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIspec\-IRI\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Render graph data into files in an owned directory
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-dest\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-graph\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-valid\-at\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-server\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-query\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-template\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-layout\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-path\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIspec\-IRI\fR]

